k":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-30T07:36:13-07:00","id":1377340,"title":"","content":"You just need Spirit 4 the Living Bridge effect as far as I know. You turn yourself into a 'fetish' or so to speak. Works on Wraiths.<br /> <br /> Sounds fun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26024-distant-choir","name":"Distant Choir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26024_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-30T08:05:09-07:00","id":1377343,"title":"","content":"Spirit bridge (Spirit 4) was exactly what I needed. Thank you so much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5394-argonot","name":"Argonot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-30T08:14:04-07:00","id":1377346,"title":"","content":"No problem. Out of interest, what other stuff does she want to do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26024-distant-choir","name":"Distant Choir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26024_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-30T08:37:04-07:00","id":1377350,"title":"","content":"I'll give you the whole context.<br /> <br /> My chronicle will be set in my city - Bogot\u00e1, Colombia - in the 1910s. It turns around a war Mages and Garou will have for one of the most powerful nodes in the world. The node is currently controlled by the Celestial Chorus, which have a chantry there, closed to everyone but them. Eventually, they will be overwhelmed by the shapeshifters constant attacks, leaving them no option but to open their Chantry to all the Traditions. Thanks to their support, they defeat the Garou once and for all and the place becomes a multitraditional Chantry. The story will take them through that transition.<br /> <br /> The medium is an NPC character, based on a real life person. Her husband is a famous physician and one of the pioneers of spiritism here. It is mentioned in many records - all of them about him, surprise surprise - that she was the actual medium. She has become an Euthanatos (only one in the city) through the Past Life background. She's powerful in Spirit, but has a limited comprehension of the other spheres. I gave her 4 in Spirit and 1 in Prime, Entropy and Mind. The idea is that she meets one of the players through a spiritist seance he's invited to. They become acquainted and think they are the only mages in town.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5394-argonot","name":"Argonot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}